  "end": 33.82
 },
 {
  "line": "Now I know what you mean",
  "section": "Verse",
  "start": 33.82,
  "end": 37.5
 },
 {
  "line": "Yours, mine",
  "section": "Chorus",
  "start": 38.92,
  "end": 40.46
 },
 {
  "line": "Keep it in the air",
  "section": "Chorus",
  "start": 41.1,
  "end": 42.74
 },
 {
  "line": "Send it somewhere I can meet you there",
  "section": "Chorus",
  "start": 42.74,
  "end": 47.52
 },
 {
  "line": "Yours, mine",
  "section": "Chorus",
  "start": 47.52,
  "end": 49.1
 },
 {
  "line": "Give it some room",
  "section": "Chorus",
  "start": 49.84,
  "end": 51.56
 },
 {
  "line": "I could spend all day",
  "section": "Chorus",
  "start": 51.56,
  "end": 53.44
 },
 {
  "line": "Sending it back to you",
  "section": "Chorus",
  "start": 53.44,
  "end": 56.68
 },
 {
  "line": "A kid on the bench puts his comic down",
  "section": "Verse",
  "start": 70.86,
  "end": 76.18
 },
 {
  "line": "Starts counting every time it comes around",
  "section": "Verse",
  "start": 76.18,
  "end": 80.54
 },
 {
  "line": "At twenty-nine he’s up on his feet",
  "section": "Verse",
  "start": 80.54,
  "end": 85.04
 },
 {
  "line": "At thirty he forgets to count",
  "section": "Verse",
  "start": 85.04,
  "end": 88.84
 },
 {
  "line": "You take two steps for a shot out wide",
  "section": "Verse",
  "start": 89.23,
  "end": 93.28
 },
 {
  "line": "I know by now where your left hand likes it",
  "section": "Verse",
  "start": 93.28,
  "end": 98.12
 },
 {
  "line": "Funny how much we’ve got to say",
  "section": "Verse",
  "start": 98.12,
  "end": 101.92
 },
 {
  "line": "With a ball and a strip of white tape",
  "section": "Verse",
  "start": 102.54,
  "end": 106.58
 },
 {
  "line": "Off the edge",
  "section": "Break",
  "start": 106.58,
  "end": 108.66
 },
 {
  "line": "Into the grass",
  "section": "Break",
  "start": 108.98,
  "end": 110.72
 },
 {
  "line": "Three pairs of shoes",
  "section": "Break",
  "start": 110.72,
  "end": 112.6
 },
 {
  "line": "Go chasing after that",
  "section": "Break",
  "start": 112.6,
  "end": 115.4
 },
 {
  "line": "The kid comes up with it cupped in his hands",
  "section": "Bridge",
  "start": 115.4,
  "end": 120.24
 },
 {
  "line": "You turn your paddle round, pass him the handle",
  "section": "Bridge",
  "start": 120.78,
  "end": 124.7
 },
 {
  "line": "He asks, “How many points to win?”",
  "section": "Bridge",
  "start": 124.7,
  "end": 127.62
 },
 {
  "line": "I hear myself say, “You’ll see”",
  "section": "Bridge",
  "start": 128.58,
  "end": 133.68
 },
 {
  "line": "Yours, mine",
